# Ultimecia, Temporal Threat ({4}{U}{U}): "When Ultimecia enters, tap all creatures your opponents control" taps Bot2's Canyon Minotaur and leaves Bot1's
# own Ornithopter untapped. "Whenever a creature you control deals combat damage to a player, draw a card": on turn 4 Bot2's Minotaur hits Bot1 for 3 and
# Bot1 draws nothing; on turn 5 the Minotaur is still tapped from attacking, so Ultimecia is unblocked, deals 4 to Bot2 and Bot1 draws exactly one card.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Sapphire
Mox Jet
Mox Emerald
Ornithopter
Ultimecia, Temporal Threat
Island
Island x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Ruby
Canyon Minotaur
Island x17

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot1.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot2.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Red)
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Canyon Minotaur.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Blue)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Ultimecia, Temporal Threat.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot2.Battlefield.Canyon Minotaur.Tapped = true
? Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Tapped = false
? Bot1.Hand.Count = 2
[T4 Bot2.DeclareAttackers]
Bot2.Attack(Canyon Minotaur > Bot1)
[T4 Bot2.Main2]
? Bot1.Life = 17
? Bot1.Hand.Count = 2
[T5 Bot1.DeclareAttackers]
Bot1.Attack(Ultimecia, Temporal Threat > Bot2)
[T5 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot2.Life = 16
Bot1.Hand.Count = 4
